om/v/t64.5771-25/473391859_1518112312188611_1355305485291339783_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VaOQvnO95ZAQ7kNvwEeoz16&_nc_oc=Adkn0rEIpe_grxKqyyO7PBo99xpdM4nrWy4aQgS8_tNd2QyXA2lTdLEDT6xiJl0HyZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwrQDHZjvz0Cuinr7XH5h30CVDoznnXsdbWIATa0Uy78g&oe=69AFF804"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00040.png", "id": "628702753183188", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393195_628702759849854_3453678486927347405_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rWBDt1tEaC0Q7kNvwEu0QQH&_nc_oc=Adn0rssiHJCVBoNJ4bilsfeAJtjyXb_po514t0PEYzENxNgOffM32kPfzpSfvNWuFzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXDWF42aLXkEP-gT1fnSJHYyGFSd4sGg-Cvlh6zGvNJA&oe=69B01008"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00041.png", "id": "1127727558894208", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393558_1127727562227541_6305939956224130709_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ukEQSIvu3HEQ7kNvwFWEoOw&_nc_oc=AdlsolFqLOywqMh3TGfoxFQd8UJCuZvvnPiPB6LucGnoqrRmCYtK0DOF3ZgsU985u8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxbOuyYpyObayr-8Za1d9TvC-URxBCvq9j2OvxBPeQERQ&oe=69B01493"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00039.png", "id": "1139738020612460", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391739_1139738023945793_5280059691858437436_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9JROWFeO4x8Q7kNvwHXHdY6&_nc_oc=AdmJmHDVXqINiqk2-X5NbEOIf6Bu8DRAuLJEVS3DeXxhvqvK7BzCWSk6ef2vt29GVEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw8MzsHtAF8QAmrZ--KlQwYgqLeLGpqL0t9sLWNNzJdDA&oe=69B01FAB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled (15).png", "id": "646952687853124", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393453_646952694519790_7054400811726926357_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qbcvIc_svKIQ7kNvwFbWDtE&_nc_oc=AdnXnxYRJ4M1kdgAbScWr8HLoB4lOZO0lj-q2pG5RD6dcybF7Gy7186m_HxvMNrHRUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzN_Xxok3I8INdBT_tnGoRL-hVTLKA7qc95Up9MmH8trg&oe=69B02D2C"}, "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "keywords": ["videoplatform", "blog", "blogger", "interactive"], "long_description": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content consumption is limited to flat, 2D screens. No matter how immersive the storytelling, you\u2019re still just an observer, not a participant.\n\nMetaBlogger VR revolutionizes content consumption by making it interactive, responsive, and fully immersive. Instead of passively watching a video, you step inside a VR-powered world where AI-driven metabloggers replace traditional human creators. These AI hosts are not just digital avatars\u2014they respond instantly to your questions, adapt to your interests, and engage with you in a way that no pre-recorded video ever could.", "short_description": "MetaBlogger lets you engage with AI-powered metabloggers in real time. Interrupt, ask questions, and get instant responses as you explore a new era of interactive media. \nKey Features:\n- AI-driven metabloggers instead of human creators\n - Real-time interaction\u2014ask questions anytime"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alindor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"},